 "qwen3_4b_one_token": {
  "what": "Qwen3-4B's mean KL (0.0103) is one token: without it the mean is 0.0035. Diagnosed 2026-11-19 20:21 over the first four pieces of the same text, each run's logits saved and compared token by token (KL from the saved 16-bit log-probabilities, which stop 16 below the largest logit, so the largest reads 8.26 where llama-perplexity's own figure is 14.02).",
  "where": "piece 1, position 449: after '...GPU-only and NPU + GPU](https://cyron', the third time that address appears in the text; the next token is 'ius'",
  "probability_of_the_next_token": {
   "gpu_alone": 0.1651,
